DESCRIPTION:"Fader Friends x Cosmic Egg" Datum: 07.11.2026 | Einlass: 22:00 Uhr Beginn: 22:00 | Ende: Uhr  VVK 5 € / AK 7 € Fader Friends joins forces with Cosmic Egg for their debut party in Vienna.   The purple egg cracks open\, electric rays pierce the dark\, and a massive line-up rides the waves. The Founder of Cosmic Egg also celebrates his birthday\, so expect a wild night that moves through a thick spectrum of electronic genres. Step into the glow\, feel the charge\, and be there when the egg hatches. You don't want to miss it.  Line-up: Gåpe Wert\, Nikø Nøx\, Adrialin\, Enoltra b2b The Bear\, Limunoise\, Zer0Ton1n b2b RIETVELD\, Zer0Ton1n (closing set)
